                                "sense_id": "16530247-6d1d-366c-8462-41bf4abaac21",
                                "text": "Elohim (Elohim)\n I shall not forgive\n Adonai (Adonai)\n I shall not forgive\n Living God (Living God)\n I shall not the forgive\n Jesus Christ (Jesus Christ)\n I forgive Thee not"
                            }
